    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sneak\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak\">Sneak</a> application of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> skill to hide from electronic surveillance and sensors. Any opponent attempting to detect you with sensors or electronic surveillance must beat your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check.<br><br>You need only roll a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check to avoid both electronic notice and notice by conventional means, using the same result as the DC for both <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> checks made to detect you.",
